id=azenith-ai
name=Azenith-AI
version=v1.0.19-wifitweak
versionCode=1142
author=AzenithTech.
description=v1.0.19: WiFi Tweak (toggle tersendiri di tab Kontrol, 15 perintah cmd wifi dengan cek dukungan ROM + revert) & Fast Charger ditambah kunci suhu zona thermal (diport dari disable_thermal, bisa dikembalikan, zona baterai tidak disentuh) + pengaman suhu baterai FC_BATT_MAX_C. v1.0.18: Perf Lite (toggle di tab Kontrol, di bawah Mode Thermal) - profil ringan & hemat daya: swappiness/vfs_cache_pressure/LMK, rate limit governor + uclamp + Adreno, grafis/UI (HWC), read-ahead + FSTrim otomatis, kurangi log/trace. Bisa bareng Balanced; PowerSaver & ZAI-Turbo dikunci, Fast Charger otomatis mati. v1.0.17: indikator latensi memakai ICMP ping nyata via root (WiFi & data seluler) + fallback HTTP, fix log WIFILL salah BUG. v1.0.16: WiFi Low Latency (toggle tersendiri + tabel latensi WebSocket/Network API di kartu Jaringan), Scan Kernel dengan upload berkas & cek kompatibilitas fitur (BISA/SEBAGIAN/TIDAK BISA). An AI Companion module to optimize gaming performance, stabilize FPSGO, bypass thermal throttling, netboost, and smart charge management. Adds a safe CPU/GPU frequency controller using per-policy cpufreq limits and kernel-provided OPP tables; slider cannot select unsupported frequencies or exceed kernel CPU limits. The write-and-verify engine it used is kept internally, because the four performance modes (balance/saver/gaming/ZAI-Turbo) depend on it: every mode writes real CPU/GPU freq+governor sysfs nodes and reads them back to confirm the kernel actually accepted the value (chmod 666 retry + $RUNDIR/oc_rejected log on real rejection), instead of just flipping a cosmetic switch in the UI. ZAI-Turbo (extreme) now also applies RaiRin-AI's MTK unlock method: /proc/cpudvfs/cpufreq_debug as a second lower-level CPU freq lock (write-verify-retry up to 3x), DVFSRC DDR/Vcore unlock, and gpufreq/battery/thermal power-limit flag unlock, so no hidden vendor subsystem clamps the ceiling back down after it is written. Cooling SoC per-game (slider 0-4 di tab Game): thermal decay via power limiting - plafon CPU/GPU turun bertahap saat suhu SoC asli melewati pemicu, governor conservative/powersave, cooling_device cpu/gpu aman, RAPL Intel/AMD; semua node di-backup dan dikembalikan otomatis. zRAM manager di tab Battery (di bawah Pembersih Sistem): algoritma, ukuran, swappiness, status mm_stat, swapoff>reset>comp_algorithm>disksize>mkswap>swapon dengan rollback otomatis.
